    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 1,
    "summary": "Abraham seeks the blessings of the patriarchal order—He is persecuted by false priests in Chaldea—Jehovah saves him—The origins and government of Egypt are reviewed.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [
      {
        "type": "introduction",
        "text": "A Translation of some ancient Records that have fallen into our hands from the catacombs of Egypt. The writings of Abraham while he was in Egypt, called the Book of Abraham, written by his own hand, upon papyrus."
      }
    ],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "In the land of the Chaldeans, at the residence of my fathers, I, Abraham, saw that it was needful for me to obtain another place of residence;",
