        "reference": "The Book of Abraham 1:8",
        "book": "The Book of Abraham",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that the priest made an offering unto the god of Pharaoh, and also unto the god of Shagreel, even after the manner of the Egyptians. Now the god of Shagreel was the sun.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
